<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Reset Your Password - MenuGo</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #ef4444;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
      border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #ef4444;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background-color: #dc2626;
    }
    .alert-box {
      background-color: #fef2f2;
      border-left: 4px solid #ef4444;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Reset Your Password 🔒</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Hello {{name}},</h2>
      
      <p>We received a request to reset the password for your MenuGo account. Click the button below to create a new password:</p>
      
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="button">Reset Password</a>
      </div>
      
      <p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
      <p style="background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; word-break: break-all;">
        {{resetUrl}}
      </p>
      
      <div class="alert-box">
        <strong>⚠️ Important Security Information:</strong>
        <ul style="margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 0;">
          <li>This password reset link will expire in <strong>1 hour</strong></li>
          <li>If you didn't request this password reset, please ignore this email</li>
          <li>For security reasons, never share this link with anyone</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <hr>
      
      <p><strong>Need help?</strong> If you're having trouble resetting your password, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@menugo.com">support@menugo.com</a></p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br>
      <strong>The MenuGo Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2024 MenuGo. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>
        <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Unsubscribe</a> | 
        <a href="{{privacyUrl}}">Privacy Policy</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>